Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 06:58:02 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 042/207] Merge dsv41/port-idxsplit (f3c1c452c) into candidate
 D

Squashed merge of 5 commits:
- deepseek: split long prefill index selections by rows over TP2 (TF_DSV41_IDX_SPLIT) (Jay Leaton)
- tp: carry a family's own settings in the bootstrap's settings digest (Jay Leaton)
- deepseek: TF_DSV41_IDX_SPLIT cut from the rows alone, agreed at the TP bootstrap (Jay Leaton)
- deepseek: TF_DSV41_IDX_SPLIT exactness oracle over the emitted programs (Jay Leaton)
- deepseek: TF_DSV41_IDX_SPLIT gate fixes: no shadowed names, auto's gather count (Jay Leaton)
